# the #75 quality-probe baselines are the evidence the requant series is measured against,
# not a throwaway run: four runs, 1.4 MB of records and summaries (2026-09-18). The server
# logs beside them stay out through the *.log rule below.
!decode_out/quality-probe/
decode_out/quality-probe/*
!decode_out/quality-probe/*/
decode_out/quality-probe/*/*
!decode_out/quality-probe/*/records.jsonl
!decode_out/quality-probe/*/run.json
!decode_out/quality-probe/*/summary.md
oracle/golden/
oracle/routing-selections.npz
*.log
*.err
*.out
# the release checksum log is evidence for the quant package, not a measurement artefact (F1, #57)
!/SHA256SUMS.log
engine/.engine.lock

# per-run scratch output of `decode run` (overwritten every run)
engine/decode_out/run.json
.superpowers/
# the upload package is hard links to the 105 GB quant payload, never committed (F3, #58)
hf-package/
